CREDITS — "WOH LADY JO NVIDIA KE ANDAR THI" · 2-minute Urban Sketch style demo

Everything in this film was drawn and synthesised in code for this project.
No stock footage, no photographs, no real faces, no logos.

Voice
- Microsoft Edge TTS, voice hi-IN-SwaraNeural, rate +12%, generated via the
  project's GitHub Actions pipeline (superz1402/opus-video-engine, workflow
  opus-voice, run 43001949810). Word timings from the same run's WordBoundary
  output drive the captions and cut points.

Music & sound
- Score: original jazz waltz in D minor, composed for this film and rendered
  procedurally (walking bass, brushes, piano, flute and clarinet leads
  synthesised with numpy/scipy in mix.py). No samples, no third-party music.
- Foley: all procedural (pen on paper, brush washes, rain, page turn, cards,
  drip), synthesised in mix.py from the timeline's event list.

Fonts (both SIL Open Font License 1.1; licence texts in project/fonts/)
- Caveat — designed by Pablo Impallari; from the Google Fonts repository.
- Reenie Beanie — designed by James Grieshaber; from the Google Fonts
  repository.

Style & tools
- Film style: "Urban Sketch · Pen & Wash" from the lemo-opuscar style library
  (used under its licence; the library's demo film, story and sign-off are not
  used). Rendering/mux pipeline: the library's core tools (headless Chrome
  frame capture, ffmpeg two-pass loudnorm mux).

Facts
- The narration is the opening of the project's own documentary script,
  written from the project's graded source notes (see ../../00-SOURCE-NOTES.md).
  All people are fictional ink sketches with blank faces, per the style's rule.
